For two neighboring points separated by $dx^{m}$, define the squared distance $\boxed{
  ds^{2}
  =
  g_{mn}(x)\,dx^{m}dx^{n}.}$ Both vector indices are contracted against the two lower metric indices, so $ds^{2}$ is a scalar.

