Apply the same operation to the displacement: $dx_{m}=g_{mn}\,dx^{n}.$ The squared interval then has three equivalent forms, $\boxed{
  ds^{2}
  =
  g_{mn}\,dx^{m}dx^{n}
  =
  dx^{m}dx_{m}
  =
  g^{mn}\,dx_{m}dx_{n}.}$

